'''Phantasmagoria''' (マジカ幻想郷 ''Majika Gensōkyō'', '''Magica Land of Fantasy''') is the 28th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 126th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Arguably one of the easiest sub-chapters in this portion of [[Zero Legends]] due to reliance on outdated stage design. This can be seen clearly in [[Taurus Trail]] and [[Drag-Inn]] with the inclusion of enemies that haven't been threatening since early [[Uncanny Legends]] or even mid-late [[Stories of Legend]].

